# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 14. Keep Project Source Code and Documentation
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Python source code: tracked
# SQL scripts: tracked
# Airflow DAGs: tracked
# Dockerfiles and Compose configurations: tracked
# dbt models, macros and tests: tracked
# YAML configuration templates: tracked
# Markdown documentation: tracked
# Architecture diagrams and screenshots: tracked
# Synthetic sample data can be added selectively later

